     1→/**
     2→ * MediaContextSAF — Android 11+ (API 30+) provider.
     3→ *
     4→ * Uses the Storage Access Framework (SAF) to read WhatsApp statuses.
     5→ * The user grants a folder URI once; the grant persists across reboots.
     6→ * A native Java module (SafReaderModule) handles the BFS + file listing
     7→ * on a background thread so the JS thread is never blocked by SAF I/O.
     8→ */
     9→import React, {
